msgid "Chassis_R97_Object_140_hound_TLXXL"
msgstr "Object 140 Resistor"

msgid "R113M_WT"
msgstr "R-113 Resistor"

msgid "R97_Object_140_hound_TLXXL"
msgstr "Resistor"

msgid "R97_Object_140_hound_TLXXL_descr"
msgstr ""
"The Resistor shoves raw plasma into every single shell. With a gun like "
"this, von Krieger's latest monstrosity won't last the afternoon. It's "
"overdriven and vicious; all I need. And as for his Blitzträger? Bigger isn't"
" better. Every shot we land is a small argument against everything he's ever"
" bolted together. Although, between us, I'm not sure the man driving it is "
"still the man. The way he talks lately, something else might be picking his "
"words. Doesn't matter. Whoever's at the controls is going to catch the same "
"plasma."

msgid "R97_Object_140_hound_TLXXL_short"
msgstr "Resistor"

msgid "R97_Object_140_hound_TLXXL_short_special"
msgstr "Major modernization of the main battle tank"

msgid "TD-12_WT"
msgstr "TD-12 Resistor"

msgid "Turret_1_R97_Object_140_hound_TLXXL"
msgstr "Object 140 Resistor"

msgid "_100mm_D54_TS_WT"
msgstr "100 mm U-8TS Resistor"

msgid "_100mm_UBR-412PB_WT"
msgstr "Silver Bullet"

msgid "_100mm_UBR-412PB_WT_descr"
msgstr "Pride of the Alliance armorers"

msgid "_100mm_UBR-412PB_WT_long_special"
msgstr ""
"Each overloaded Generator will charge Silver Bullet with Plasma. The more "
"Charges, the more damage Plasma causes. Shoot when the Blitzträger's shield "
"is down for maximum damage."

msgid "_100mm_UBR-412PB_WT_short_special"
msgstr "Additional damage with Plasma"
